==English==
===Verb===
'''[[blow]] the [[whistle]]'''
#{{idiom}} To [[report]] a [[problem]] or [[violation]] to the [[authorities]].
#:''Some laws say that people cannot be fired for '''blowing the whistle''' on an employer.''

#To [[referee]] in a team sports match, more usually to [[signal]] the end of the game.

